{"id":"b8b8df152b92c5d9","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-recursion-theorem.md","title":"Kleene's Recursion Theorem","display":"thm-recursion-theorem — Kleene's Recursion Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-recursion-theorem","aliases":["90-thm-recursion-theorem"],"display":"thm-recursion-theorem — Kleene's Recursion Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursion-theorem]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[88-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-recursion-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-recursion-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recursion-theorem — Kleene's Recursion Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40d9084cba778b26\" href=\"?note=40d9084cba778b26\" title=\"90-df-recursion-theorem\">90-df-recursion-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定编号族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span> 及部分函数等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li>要求 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span>；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{f(e)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{f(e)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_2\">\\(s\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_2\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{s(a,b)}(x)\\simeq\\varphi_a^{(2)}(b,x)\">\\(\\varphi_{s(a,b)}(x)\\simeq\\varphi_a^{(2)}(b,x)\\)</span>。给定全递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，下述二元部分函数是部分递归的：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(z,x)\">\\((z,x)\\)</span> 上先算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(z,z)\">\\(s(z,z)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(s(z,z))\">\\(f(s(z,z))\\)</span>，然后模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{f(s(z,z))}(x)\">\\(\\varphi_{f(s(z,z))}(x)\\)</span>。取它的二元程序索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=s(a,a)\">\\(e=s(a,a)\\)</span>。则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq\\varphi_a^{(2)}(a,x)\\simeq\n\\varphi_{f(s(a,a))}(x)=\\varphi_{f(e)}(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq\\varphi_a^{(2)}(a,x)\\simeq\n\\varphi_{f(s(a,a))}(x)=\\varphi_{f(e)}(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>最后一个等号只更换相同的索引表达式；整个链按部分值相等解释，包含共同发散情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原来的外延递归定理陈述；可接受性现在有实际定义来源。它不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(e)=e\">\\(f(e)=e\\)</span> 的数值固定点命题。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 用于证明，不被重复并入固定点结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"40d9084cba778b26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursion-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"2e54d7c09866228f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定编号族 $\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}$、$\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}$ 及部分函数等号 $\\simeq$ 见 [[90-df-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"要求 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"要求 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"要求 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$；本书的具体编号满足该条件，见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"2e54d7c09866228f","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Proof]","excerpt":"由 [[88-thm-smn]] 取 $s\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_2$ 使 $\\varphi_{s(a,b)}(x)\\simeq\\varphi_a^{(2)}(b,x)$。给定全递归 $f$，下述二元部分函数是部分递归的：在 $(z,x)$ 上先算 $s(z,z)$、$f(s(z,z))$，然后模拟 $\\varphi_{f(s(z,z))}(x)$。取它的二元程序索引 $a$，令 $e=s(a,a)$。则","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{PartRec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_{f(e)}.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{s(a,b)}(x)\\simeq\\varphi_a^{(2)}(b,x)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"(z,x)","display":false},{"tex":"s(z,z)","display":false},{"tex":"f(s(z,z))","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{f(s(z,z))}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"e=s(a,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e(x)\\simeq\\varphi_a^{(2)}(a,x)\\simeq\n\\varphi_{f(s(a,a))}(x)=\\varphi_{f(e)}(x).","display":true},{"tex":"f(e)=e","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1829,"backlinks":[{"id":"3e426ba53e1b66a0","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"二元投影 $(e,x)\\mapsto e$ 有一个程序索引；由 [[88-thm-smn]] 固化第一参数，得到上述全递归 $c$。对 $c$ 应用 [[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]，所得固定点程序在输入 $0$ 上输出 $e$。"},{"id":"506fa337f5ea6068","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"将所给 $f$ 代入 [[90-thm-recursion-theorem]]；该定理的编号条件正是本文件显式列出的 $\\mathrm{AcceptNum}$。"},{"id":"8c2be80a12f6ee89","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 $F$ 的二元索引 $a$。由 [[88-thm-smn]]，$c(n)=s(a,n)$ 是全递归索引变换，且 $\\varphi_{c(n)}(x)\\simeq F(n,x)$。对 $c$ 应用 [[90-thm-recursion-theorem]] 即得所求 $e$。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-thm-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal.md]]\n[[90-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-fixed-point-algorithm.md]]\n[[90-thm-kleene-second-recursion.md]]\n[[90-thm-min-closure-rec.md]]\n[[90-thm-myhill-operator.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursion-theorem.md]]\n[[90-thm-recursive-set-representation.md]]\n[[90-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[90-thm-smullyan-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]"}],"outgoing":["40d9084cba778b26"